news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQTmZpTUFLVXRNUk44U0U0ZE11bF9KakFQdDlIQ2RMdS13el9uc1lCeTlkcmg2N0ZETk5Ra3VoUEc2ZjhqZFFUU3RZNkJocXlRT09CSjZBVk5ld3IyUkpmVE5BTURKS0J4ZDR3c0RwQU1UM1lmbzN0SmJJMC1CUmczbm42MzZUSnFZM1FMakN3WmpyTHJrUnY4VVVDVzNmV3lzWExVZQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"聯邦房地產超出第三季預期，調高指引"},{"title":"Federal Realty Investment Trust Reports Q3 Earnings of $0.74 per","src":"GuruFocus","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"聯邦房地產投資信託報告第三季收益為每股 0.74 美元"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":13},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/34903/000003490326000017/frt-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Federal Realty Investment Trust (the \"Parent Company\" or the \"Trust\") is an equity real estate investment trust (\"REIT\"). Federal Realty OP LP (the \"Operating Partnership\") is the entity through which the Trust conducts substantially all of its operations and owns substantially all of its assets. The Trust owns 100% of the limited liability company interest of, is sole member of, and exercises exclusive control over Federal Realty GP LLC (the \"General Partner\"), which in turn, is the sole","zh":"聯邦房地產投資信託（「母公司」或「信託」）是一種股權房地產投資信託（「REIT」）。 Federal Realty OP LP（「營運合夥企業」）是信託公司透過其開展幾乎所有業務並擁有其幾乎所有資產的實體。該信託擁有 Federal Realty GP LLC（「普通合夥人」）100% 的有限責任公司權益，是該公司的唯一成員，並對其行使獨家控制權，而該公司又是該公司的唯一成員。"},{"en":"general partner of the Operating Partnership. Unless stated otherwise or the context otherwise requires, \"we,\" \"our,\" and \"us\" means the Trust and its business and operations conducted through its directly and indirectly owned subsidiaries, including the Operating Partnership. We specialize in the ownership, management, and redevelopment of high quality retail and mixed-use properties. These properties are located primarily in major coastal markets and select underserved markets that we believe have strong economic and demographic fundamentals. As of December 31, 2025, we owned or had a majority interest in community and neighborhood shopping centers and mixed-use properties which are operated as 104 predominantly retail real estate projects comprising approximately 28.8 million commercial square feet. In total, the real estate projects were 96.1% leased and 94.1% occupied at December 31","zh":"經營合夥企業的普通合夥人。除非另有說明或上下文另有要求，否則「我們」、「我們的」和「我們的」是指信託及其透過其直接和間接擁有的子公司（包括營運合夥企業）開展的業務和營運。我們專注於高品質零售和綜合用途物業的所有權、管理和重建。這些房產主要位於主要沿海市場以及我們認為具有強勁經濟和人口基本面的服務欠缺市場。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們擁有或擁有社區和鄰裡購物中心以及混合用途物業的多數權益，這些物業以 104 個主要零售房地產項目的形式運營，商業面積約為 2,880 萬平方英尺。截至12月31日，房地產項目出租率為96.1%，入住率為94.1%"},{"en":"Our portfolio includes, and we continue to acquire and redevelop, high quality retail in many formats ranging from regional, community and neighborhood shopping centers that often are anchored by grocery stores to mixed-use properties that are typically centered around a retail component but also include residential and office components.","zh":"我們的投資組合包括，並且我們將繼續收購和重新開發多種形式的高品質零售，從通常以雜貨店為主的區域、社區和鄰裡購物中心，到通常以零售部分為中心但也包括住宅和辦公部分的混合用途物業。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Numerous commercial developers and real estate companies compete with us with respect to the leasing and the acquisition of properties. Some of these competitors may possess greater capital resources than we do, although we do not believe that any single competitor or group of competitors in any of the primary markets where our properties are located are dominant in that market. This competition may:","zh":"許多商業開發商和房地產公司在租賃和收購房產方面與我們競爭。其中一些競爭對手可能擁有比我們更多的資本資源，儘管我們不認為我們的物業所在的任何主要市場中的任何單一競爭對手或競爭對手群體在該市場中佔據主導地位。本次比賽可能："},{"en":"Retailers at our properties also face increasing competition from online retailers, outlet stores, discount shopping clubs, superstores, and other forms of sales and marketing of goods and services, such as direct mail. This competition could contribute to lease defaults and insolvency of tenants.","zh":"我們飯店的零售商還面臨著來自線上零售商、直銷店、折扣購物俱樂部、超市以及其他形式的商品和服務銷售和行銷（例如直郵）的日益激烈的競爭。這種競爭可能會導致租賃違約和租戶破產。"}],"segments":{},"peers":["ESS","REG","KIM","NNN","BXP"]}}